/               CCL ENTRY   :  00201
/
/       00200-00377     ENTRY POINT AND STARTUP CODE
/       00000-01777     COMMAND DECODER
/       00000-02777     INPUT DIRECTORY
/       10000-11777     USER SERVICE ROUTINE
/       12000-13577     FILE LOOKUP MODIFIED FROM 'DIRECT.PA'
/       20000-27577     DEC-10 PROGRAM
