/
/TO ASSEMBLE AND LOAD:
/
/       .COM DEC10
/       .LOAD DEC10
/       .SAVE SYS DEC10
/
/       TO USE "PIP" FOR SENDING FILES:
/               1. REMOVE THE COMMENT "/" FROM PIP=0 ABOVE
/               2. ASSEMBLE, LOAD, SAVE AND USE AS ABOVE
/
/       TO USE "SEND3" FOR SENDING FILES:
/               1. ASSEMBLE, LOAD, AND SAVE AS FOR "PIP"
/               2. SEND "SEND3.FAI" TO THE PDP-10
/               3. ASSEMBLE, LOAD AND SAVE "SEND3" ON THE PDP-10
/               4. REASSEMBLE, LOAD, AND SAVE DEC10 WITH "PIP" UNDEFINED
/
/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\
